> write to it.
>
> # cd /usr/var/ase/mnt/newnfsservice/newdir
> # touch newfile
> [it works!]
> #
>
> What have I done and how can I make it OK again
> (preferably without dismounting the system/
> restarting ASE etc) ?
>
> Thanks!  I will summarize
> John

