Many thanks go to
John Speakman  speakman@biost.mskcc.org
Juan Carlos Burbano jburbano@uio.compuequip.com
Don Rye             rye@jwfc.jfcom.mil

who assured me that the mail facility should be part of the SWCC software.
And now I found it: it is part of the software that must be installed on the
unix machine having a HSZ70 attached (for Raid Array 200 you need a  different
