Thanks to Dr. Tom Blinn, Zeev Fischer.

Problem was: btcreate included in shell script cannot be run in
non-interactive mode.

Shivraja Gowda via Walt Kopy gives the option '-d temp-directory' , was
missing.
line command so is :

/usr/sys/bin/btcreate -f -k MACHINE -m mfs -d /usr/sys/bin -t nrmt0h=20
-a /usr/lib/sabt/etc/addlist=20
-s /usr/lib/sabt/etc/fslist


That's working well for me ( DS40 TU V4.0F TLZ10)




