i) not saving in so many groups. (which we do.)
ii) starting savegroup with option '-x'
iii) creating a dummy savegroup-script and starting nsrim by cron weekly.

additionally most people said, that networker seems quite buggy in the
5.5 and 5.2 release, which is rather disappointing.

yours,
andreas bunten


